<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's Japan Power Generation offers shares.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's Japan Power Generation offers shares.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's Japan Power Generation Ltd on Tuesday invited public subscription for 13.8 million 10-rupee shares on October 23.</p>
<p>The firm plans to build a 135.6-megawatt plant at Raiwind near Lahore to be completed by October 1997.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
